*   EXCEPTIONS
*     PARAMETER_ERROR        = 1
*     NO_VALUES_FOUND        = 2
*     OTHERS                 = 3
            .
  IF sy-subrc <> 0.
* Implement suitable error handling here
  ENDIF.

  IF IT_RETURN IS NOT INITIAL.
    READ TABLE IT_RETURN ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<WA>) INDEX 1.
